  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 200C. Cut the capsicums into 1cm chunks. Peel the carrots, halve lengthwise and thinly slice. Crush or finely chop 1 garlic clove. Drain and rinse the black beans. Coarsely grate the cheese.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/138828/photos/large/prep_ingredients-cc7e4179c1692e1f1e434f5248b1fe09.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook soup base: Heat 1 tbs olive oil in a medium saucepan over medium heat. Cook the capsicum, carrot and garlic, stirring, for 3-4 mins until softened. Add 2 tsp Mexican spice blend and cook, stirring, for 1 min. Add 1 tbs tomato paste and cook for 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/138829/photos/large/cook_soup_base-1c07b3ca954e7909b631f47bd3b809cb.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make tortilla crisps: Add the tomatoes and 500ml (2 cups) water to the pan and stir to combine. Bring to a simmer, then reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, for 10 mins. Meanwhile, line an oven tray with baking paper. Put 2 wraps on the tray and scatter over the cheese. Bake for 6-8 mins until melted, golden and crisp. Cut into strips or shards.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/138830/photos/large/make_tortilla_dippers-dfbfdce180a656e4b3d97a82807c9a4c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Finish soup: Put the black beans in a bowl and gently mash to a chunky consistency. Add the beans to the soup and season well with salt and pepper. Cook, covered, for 5-7 mins until the beans are warmed through. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/138831/photos/large/finish_soup-96ed99d3049e497d409b3add6571b150.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the soup among bowls and top with some cheesy tortilla crisps. Serve the remaining crisps on the side and enjoy.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/138832/photos/large/serve_up-eb9f05c404892246b05a5db4dc93f36b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Go for the full Mexican experience and top your soup with sour cream and scatter with fresh coriander.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/138833/photos/large/make_it_yours-6bed68e60147a40ce20c4317c4942021.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
